	(text "DN1: the Melzi, DN2: the tool (CAT6 #2),\nDN3: the plot bed board (J1002), DN4: the Aux\nMCU. DN1, DN2, DN4: data only, their VBUS\npads not connected. One TT: the full-speed\nMCUs share 12 Mbit/s; the Pi Zero tool\n(high speed) has the 480."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01829135-3a18-4c1d-9598-5ee17019e8fd")
	)
	(text "~0.2 A measured. It enumerates when U1006\nturns on (its D+ pull-up runs from its\nown 5 V). Shut it down over USB before\nGP9 drops its 5 V (or a read-only root)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 274.32 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16f198f6-5ebb-4e76-a869-658ae87beae6")
	)
	(text "The Melzi: its own 12 V, VBUS cut.\nThe Aux MCU: MP_Buck0, VBUS cut."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b495b36-993e-4968-b770-9610fc5c4179")
	)
	(text "Pad: wire = signal\n1-3: white-orange, -green,\n     -brown = +5V_TOOL\n6-8: orange, green, brown = GND\n4: white-blue = USB D+\n5: blue = USB D-\n\nThree wires each way: MX1.25\ncontacts ~1 A each.\nHead end: J956 (sheet Plot\nhead cell)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2fbd71a5-7e97-44c7-a74c-63190a79a9f6")
	)
	(text "HUB BOARD: the USB hub and the tool's 5 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46ad316c-6f60-477b-b9a5-1d2df7e8a1e1")
	)
	(text "GROUND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d90beef-f922-4e69-8421-0ce984ea17ae")
	)
	(text "TO THE PLOT BED BOARD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e120888-7b6f-4577-bfd7-ef87437df6ad")
	)
	(text "On only when the host says so (key locked, the ID\nsays \"power me\"): GP9 on the plot bed board, over\nJ1002. R1002 holds it off with the link out or\nthrough a reset. Slide switch at OFF (else always on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "51a2ba6e-4e7e-4ec9-9973-18fe88cec7b6")
	)
	(text "One GND: the Pi's (USB), the 9 V's, the tool's\nreturn, the link's. The tool's current stays\non this board (CAT6 #2 to J1001); the link's\nGND carries only the plot bed board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "553bd641-ac02-4003-84d1-54b2186b4675")
	)
	(text "Pi + 9 V, J1002 out: the hub and its ports\nwork, the tool stays off (R1002). The plot\nbed board alone: its own USB-C, J957 out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d6bf320-52b2-442c-8494-1df91904004b")
	)
	(text "The tool's 5 V and CAT6 #2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f610239-97e7-478b-92f8-3c9c7bcf8bf1")
	)
	(text "FE1.1s HUB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "67c3f317-df3a-4cd8-b911-e42ba810720f")
	)
	(text "From a Pi 4 USB-A port (sheet Host),\nan A-to-C cable. VBUS: the Pi's 5 V,\nall the hub needs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "69116ac3-288b-4eda-9043-388d2465c618")
	)
	(text "+5V_HUB: the Pi's VBUS: the hub, the plot bed board\n(RAW): ~0.1-0.3 A of the Pi 4's\n1.2 A (all its ports together). +5V_TOOL_IN: MP_Buck1:\nthe tool (U1006, F1001), the bed and\n+5V_SW (U956/U957); never tied to +5V_HUB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7053c320-c76c-4874-a1e5-b9180403b130")
	)
	(text "TOOL 5 V: MP_BUCK1 FROM 9 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e8ca816-c307-4ff2-9f24-2f8ddcfbacc8")
	)
	(text "+9V: the PD trigger on C1 (sheet Power).\nIts 5 V jumper set; 47-100 uF at its input\n(hot-plug ringing)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8b1fa4d9-fc15-48f6-ac70-adde90ee9106")
	)
